cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JuliassicPark.jl in your research, please cite the software using the metadata below."
title: "JuliassicPark.jl: A flexible Julia package for evolutionary simulations"
type: software
version: 0.1.3
license: MIT

authors:
  - given-names: "Cedric"
    family-names: "Perret"

abstract: >-
  JuliassicPark.jl is a flexible Julia package for simulating evolutionary
  models with customizable fitness functions, reproduction processes,
  mutation, migration, parameter sweeps, and automatic data output.

repository-code: "https://github.com/CedricPerret/JuliassicPark"

keywords:
  - evolutionary modelling
  - evolutionary simulation
  - Julia
  - population genetics
  - cultural evolution